OL,3,AIsrael to shut down UK consulate in
OL,4,AJerusalem, after UK sanctions Israeli
OL,5,Asettlements in West Bank
OL,6,
OL,7,FForeign minister Gideon Saar says
OL,8,FIsrael will close the British consulate
OL,9,Fin Jerusalem and calls the UK
OL,10,Fgovernment "hostile"
OL,12,FIt comes after Foreign Secretary Ed
OL,13,FMiliband said the UK would ban the
OL,14,Fimport of goods from Israeli
OL,15,Fsettlements in the illegally occupied
OL,16,FWest Bank
OL,18,FSpeaking in Parliament, Miliband said
OL,19,F"ethnic cleansing" is being carried out
OL,20,Fby "settler terrorists" and accused the
OL,21,FIsraeli government of turning a "blind
OL,22,Feye"
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
