OL,3,AFour Renoir paintings worth millions
OL,4,Astolen in French museum heist
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour paintings by the impressionist
OL,7,Fartist Pierre-Auguste Renoir have been
OL,8,Fstolen from a museum in the south of
OL,9,FFrance.
OL,11,FTwo thieves broke into the Renoir
OL,12,FMuseum in Cagnes-sur-Mer on Tuesday
OL,13,Fmorning but dropped two of the
OL,14,Fpaintings in the institution's garden
OL,15,Fas they made their escape, local Mayor
OL,16,FBryan Masson said.
OL,18,F"Attacking the Renoir Museum is
OL,19,Fattacking a part of the history and
OL,20,Fheritage of Cagnes-sur-Mer," he said.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
