OL,3,AAt least two people dead after Russian
OL,4,Astrikes on Kyiv
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least two people have been killed
OL,7,Fafter Russia resumed airstrikes on the
OL,8,FUkrainian capital of Kyiv early on
OL,9,FTuesday, officials said.
OL,11,FThe attack came after both countries
OL,12,Fagreed to halt strikes on each other's
OL,13,Fcapitals for three days while US Donald
OL,14,FTrump's top envoys visited Moscow and
OL,15,FKyiv.
OL,17,FUkrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,18,Fsaid on Monday he expected the war to
OL,19,Fcontinue into the winter, following
OL,20,Ftalks with Steve Witkoff and Jared
OL,21,FKushner - their first visit to Ukraine
OL,22,Fsince Russia's full-scale invasion.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
